Bambu Keypad is adapted from Fusion-LogiMX by Craig Ulliott
(https://github.com/craigulliott/Fusion-LogiMX), MIT License, starting from
commit 44b81854085dd6a0797c183e4244690dba292863.

From upstream: plugin/ (the Logi plugin, renamed and with a configurable port),
docs/protocol.md (the protocol, with a new port), ruff.toml, .gitignore and LICENSE.
bridge/ is new and replaces upstream's Fusion add-in. Its navigator follows the
same page, Back and More rules. mcp-server/ was not carried over.

The original copyright notice is kept in LICENSE.
